From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] combase, bluetoothapis, tbs: exports that browsers and editors import (6022)

IsErrorPropagationEnabled, RoReportFailedDelegate,
BluetoothEnableIncomingConnections, Tbsip_Submit_Command, Tbsip_Context_Close
and Tbsip_Cancel_Commands were stubs that kill the process calling them
(Chrome, VS Code, Firefox import them).
---
diff --git a/dlls/bluetoothapis/bluetoothapis.spec b/dlls/bluetoothapis/bluetoothapis.spec
index 49bf32f..7afd8d1 100644
--- a/dlls/bluetoothapis/bluetoothapis.spec
+++ b/dlls/bluetoothapis/bluetoothapis.spec
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
